    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Numbers",
     "texto": [
      "From 0 to 16 you have to learn them by heart. From 17 to 19 they are formed by adding: **dix-sept** (ten-seven), **dix-huit**, **dix-neuf**.",
      "In **six** and **dix** on their own, the **x** sounds like /s/ («sis», «dis»); in **dix-huit** and **dix-neuf**, it sounds like /z/. The **p** in **sept** is silent. In this guide, **Z** stands for /z/ (a buzzing «s», like the English «z»)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
